OL,3,GNEWSADouble delay on road 60 years in
OL,4,Athe works
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe near-doubling of the timeline to
OL,7,Fdual a stretch of a road across
OL,8,Fnorthern England is "deeply
OL,9,Fdisappointing" and has left people
OL,10,Ffeeling frustrated, according to a
OL,11,Fresident who has seen plans come and go
OL,12,Ffor decades.
OL,14,FThe latest work on the A66 between
OL,15,FPenrith in Cumbria and Scotch Corner in
OL,16,FNorth Yorkshire will now take nine
OL,17,Fyears instead of the initial estimate
OL,18,Fof five, the government has said.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
