OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADouble delay on road 60 years in
OL,4,Athe works
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans approved by the last Conservative
OL,7,Fadministration, paused when Labour won
OL,8,Fthe 2024 election, were confirmed last
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FBut Anne Ridley, who lives in Kirkby
OL,12,FThore and whose family was first
OL,13,Fconsulted about road changes in the
OL,14,F1960s, said she was starting to doubt
OL,15,Fshe would ever see it completed.
